<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Yiu Wing shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Yiu Wing shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Yiu Wing International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Friday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of the construction and restaurant concern were up HK$0.25 or 10.53 percent to HK$2.625 at midday before the suspension.</p>
<p>Volume was 17.30 million shares worth HK$44.06 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
